<div id="alg3.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
              
              
             Compute <math id="alg3.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{\delta}}=\mathrm{rowsum}(d{\mathbf{O}}\circ{\mathbf{O}})\in\mathbb{R}^{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝜹</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>rowsum</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐎</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">∘</mo><mi>𝐎</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{\delta}}=\mathrm{rowsum}(d{\mathbf{O}}\circ{\mathbf{O}})\in\mathbb{R}^{N}</annotation></semantics></math> (pointwise multiply), and divide it into <math id="alg3.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{r}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{r}</annotation></semantics></math> blocks <math id="alg3.l4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{\delta}}_{1},\dots,{\bm{\delta}}_{T_{r}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝜹</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝜹</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{\delta}}_{1},\dots,{\bm{\delta}}_{T_{r}}</annotation></semantics></math> of size
<math id="alg3.l4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B_{r}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B_{r}</annotation></semantics></math> each.

